      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MCIVOR MORGAN (6) finds it hard to break through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (17.02) at this track. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Must come into calculations. ZIPPING CHOI (4) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, hitting the frame latest when 2nd at this track over 300m. Will give a great sight again. ZIPPING NUTTALL (1) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.5 lengths (20.19) behind Fancy Faye at Traralgon. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Can measure up. CRUISIN' GRAE (2) cannot be dismissed although new to this venue.",
